<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.sf4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(d)</span> </span><span id="S3.F2.sf4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Methods with learnable classifiers on ImageNet-R.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
