<span id="S4.T1.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T1.3.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Decision Mechanism</span></span>
</span></td>
